WEBVTT

00:08.466 --> 00:10.010
That's...

00:10.093 --> 00:11.219
Could it be...

00:12.637 --> 00:14.014
Are they human?

00:15.807 --> 00:17.434
- Fire arrows!
- Watch out!

00:17.517 --> 00:18.768
The defensive barricade is on fire!

02:01.746 --> 02:02.705
What in the world is going on?

02:03.456 --> 02:06.709
Could they be faerie-corrupted humans,
like the ones we saw in the mine?

02:06.793 --> 02:09.170
No, those guys are different...

02:10.171 --> 02:13.133
They're people allied
with the Demon Blight.

02:13.216 --> 02:14.884
But...

02:14.968 --> 02:18.930
Are there faeries
that can communicate with humans?

02:19.848 --> 02:20.682
Yes...

02:22.016 --> 02:24.769
It's said that such faeries exist.

02:25.603 --> 02:27.188
If that is the case, Xylo...

02:27.856 --> 02:30.942
I cannot attack humans.

02:31.901 --> 02:34.529
Even if they are allied
with the Demon Lord,

02:34.612 --> 02:36.781
I am mechanically unable to do so.

02:38.658 --> 02:39.617
I know.

02:40.368 --> 02:41.786
Kivia, can you hear me?

02:43.788 --> 02:44.831
What is it?

02:44.914 --> 02:47.500
The sacred communication seal is less
effective when used with non-heroes.

02:47.584 --> 02:48.710
Slow down and explain clearly.

02:49.294 --> 02:50.461
What's going on?

02:50.545 --> 02:52.338
Where did those people come from?

02:52.922 --> 02:55.091
I don't know either. However...

02:55.758 --> 02:58.261
it's definitely a noble's private army.

02:58.344 --> 03:00.179
They're skilled cavalry
and mounted archers.

03:01.973 --> 03:03.349
They've already retreated.

03:03.850 --> 03:05.476
We can't catch up to them
in our heavy armor.

03:05.560 --> 03:06.603
Damn it...

03:06.686 --> 03:08.354
The direction they're heading...

03:09.314 --> 03:11.065
Is it the underground passage?

03:16.487 --> 03:17.822
They're getting closer...

03:17.906 --> 03:19.616
Xylo, we're in trouble!

03:19.699 --> 03:21.200
A strange group of people has arrived!

03:21.284 --> 03:23.661
What if they come to me?

03:23.745 --> 03:26.664
If I die, I'll curse you forever!

03:26.748 --> 03:28.833
Are you only thinking
about your own survival?

03:28.917 --> 03:31.544
Don't worry, Venetim.

03:31.628 --> 03:34.005
Isn't Tatsuya with you?

03:34.714 --> 03:37.675
By the way, can we ask
His Majesty to retreat?

03:38.343 --> 03:40.428
Now that even the kyrack has appeared,

03:41.012 --> 03:42.972
the main gate can't hold out anymore.

03:43.056 --> 03:43.890
No.

03:43.973 --> 03:46.059
If the King retreats,

03:46.142 --> 03:48.102
the kingdom will lose
its spiritual pillar.

03:53.358 --> 03:55.610
Chancellor, where are the reinforcements?

03:57.111 --> 03:59.614
Reinforcements won't come to our aid.

03:59.697 --> 04:00.865
Besides...

04:01.449 --> 04:04.577
Come to think of it,
you're not the king, are you?

04:05.161 --> 04:06.788
In that case...

04:07.372 --> 04:09.499
Open the gunports!

04:09.582 --> 04:11.793
Opening gunports!

04:14.587 --> 04:15.964
That's...

04:16.047 --> 04:17.465
Runtels.

04:17.548 --> 04:19.968
They're sacred seal-engraved cannons

04:20.051 --> 04:22.512
developed by
the Verkle Development Corporation.

04:23.012 --> 04:25.014
Prepare to fire!

04:27.225 --> 04:28.601
Prepare to fire!

04:34.816 --> 04:37.193
Fire!

04:53.251 --> 04:55.920
The aim really isn't good enough...

04:56.004 --> 04:57.505
We can't fire continuously.

04:57.588 --> 04:59.424
The enemy will arrive
before the next volley.

05:00.842 --> 05:02.135
In that case...

05:02.218 --> 05:04.012
Commander in Chief Xylo, it's your turn!

05:04.095 --> 05:05.805
Take down the enemy general.

05:06.389 --> 05:07.265
It can't be helped...

05:08.141 --> 05:11.227
I'll take care of the humans.
Is that all right, Teoritta?

05:14.564 --> 05:15.648
Xylo.

05:16.482 --> 05:19.152
Are you really going to fight like this?

05:21.154 --> 05:22.196
What do you mean?

05:24.324 --> 05:28.119
You are always risking your life,

05:28.619 --> 05:30.747
but you always tell me not to.

05:35.209 --> 05:36.836
It doesn't matter to me.

05:36.919 --> 05:38.838
If I die, I'll be revived anyway.

05:38.921 --> 05:40.048
No.

05:40.631 --> 05:42.967
Even without that,
you would still fight, right?

05:44.218 --> 05:45.386
What are you trying to say?

05:46.220 --> 05:49.182
For the Holy Knights
and the miners at the fortress,

05:49.724 --> 05:53.853
even for those complete strangers
who are not here right now,

05:53.936 --> 05:55.813
you are always fighting for others.

05:57.065 --> 06:00.568
In the end, you are
no different from a goddess.

06:01.360 --> 06:05.656
But the reason you oppose
the very way the goddesses exist

06:06.908 --> 06:08.743
is that you reject your own kind!

06:17.919 --> 06:18.753
Damn it...

06:23.132 --> 06:24.592
Anyway, let's go.

06:25.218 --> 06:27.136
The Demon Lord is finally here.

06:28.096 --> 06:29.055
That's right.

06:29.138 --> 06:31.682
You are a hero, and I am a goddess.

06:31.766 --> 06:34.560
I must bestow my blessing
upon your battle.

06:34.644 --> 06:37.313
This is our respective duty.

06:37.939 --> 06:39.524
So it cannot be helped, right?

06:40.608 --> 06:42.985
Yes, you're absolutely right.

06:44.695 --> 06:45.530
Xylo.

06:46.030 --> 06:48.950
We must win this battle!

06:49.033 --> 06:49.867
Right.

06:50.535 --> 06:51.369
Let's go!

06:58.459 --> 06:59.961
Why would humans...

07:00.044 --> 07:02.463
Is this where we're going to die?

07:08.970 --> 07:10.346
Hey...

07:16.102 --> 07:17.061
What's going on?

07:17.145 --> 07:17.979
Where did it come from?

07:18.563 --> 07:19.939
E-Enemy incoming!

07:40.626 --> 07:41.919
Q-Quickly, back him up!

07:42.503 --> 07:44.297
Everyone, fire!

07:56.017 --> 07:57.477
He... He vanished!

08:11.073 --> 08:12.742
What in the world is that thing?

08:14.911 --> 08:16.204
He's not human...

08:18.247 --> 08:19.081
That's...

08:21.209 --> 08:22.335
a Demon...

08:27.340 --> 08:28.508
Found it!

08:29.133 --> 08:30.218
It's Iblis!

08:34.722 --> 08:37.308
Minimize engagements! Go around.

08:37.391 --> 08:38.351
Understood!

08:38.935 --> 08:40.019
Take this.

08:40.102 --> 08:41.270
My knight!

08:42.104 --> 08:43.147
Alright!

08:44.232 --> 08:46.317
It's just as I imagined!

08:48.945 --> 08:50.154
Go!

09:02.333 --> 09:03.167
Xylo!

09:05.545 --> 09:06.546
Take that!

09:14.762 --> 09:16.180
Kyrack, huh?

09:17.932 --> 09:19.141
Take this!

09:24.522 --> 09:25.523
Teoritta, let's fly!

09:25.606 --> 09:26.482
Yes!

09:27.567 --> 09:28.693
What?

09:30.027 --> 09:31.362
It's a boggart?!

09:35.032 --> 09:38.536
- Xylo, I will rain down swords upon them.
- No!

09:39.328 --> 09:41.789
Save your strength for Iblis!

09:42.373 --> 09:43.958
Even if you say that...

09:50.881 --> 09:52.925
Goddamn it...

10:08.357 --> 10:10.026
Teoritta, let's retreat!

10:13.195 --> 10:14.447
Xylo, that's...

10:24.457 --> 10:26.751
Venetim, why are those guys here?

10:26.834 --> 10:28.502
Didn't I refuse their aid?

10:29.629 --> 10:32.673
Ah... Xylo, are you angry?

10:33.174 --> 10:36.135
What the hell, you actually lied to me...

10:36.218 --> 10:38.346
Then let me ask you this:

10:39.096 --> 10:42.892
why would you think
I was telling the truth?

10:44.393 --> 10:46.896
Xylo, help! This is bad!

10:46.979 --> 10:49.565
I'm screwed! I'm going to be killed!

10:49.649 --> 10:51.651
Dotta, what the hell are you doing?

10:51.734 --> 10:53.527
- I'll kill you!
- I'm being chased

10:53.611 --> 10:54.445
- Die!
- by mercenaries!

10:54.528 --> 10:55.988
What? Why?

10:56.072 --> 10:57.823
I told you to hire them!

10:57.907 --> 11:00.660
I'd have to steal the money
to hire them anyway, right?

11:00.743 --> 11:04.372
Wouldn't it be faster and easier
to just steal from the mercenaries?

11:04.455 --> 11:06.290
Enough! Shut up!

11:06.374 --> 11:08.167
Give me back my money, you brat!

11:08.250 --> 11:10.294
Disrupt the faeries' formation.

11:14.423 --> 11:16.175
The Demon Lord is also at a loss.

11:16.258 --> 11:18.469
Looks like it's not as smart as I thought.

11:19.053 --> 11:20.763
Let's fly, Teoritta!

11:25.267 --> 11:26.894
Now! Can you do it?

11:26.977 --> 11:28.646
Of course!

11:44.745 --> 11:48.332
This is a sword
that values only size and strength.

11:48.416 --> 11:49.917
It will not last long.

11:50.000 --> 11:51.877
I understand. This is enough.

11:54.088 --> 11:57.007
My blessing is splendid, isn't it?

12:03.389 --> 12:04.306
Xylo?

12:07.810 --> 12:08.936
Let's go win this.

12:12.064 --> 12:13.023
Very well!

12:28.622 --> 12:29.832
Alright...

12:32.376 --> 12:33.711
That's right! Come at me!

12:51.562 --> 12:53.564
Xylo, this is...

12:53.647 --> 12:56.192
It's the trap we set during recon.

12:56.275 --> 12:57.776
It's the weathering seal.

12:58.611 --> 12:59.737
Teoritta!

12:59.820 --> 13:00.738
Yes!

13:03.032 --> 13:05.159
With this, it all ends.

13:13.375 --> 13:16.253
This time, the swords
will not vanish immediately.

13:43.030 --> 13:45.866
I'll have Kivia and the others
bring the Goddess's poison.

13:46.367 --> 13:47.993
You stay here and rest for a bit.

13:49.578 --> 13:52.831
There's no need to sacrifice the fortress.

13:55.000 --> 13:56.710
Looks like you've calmed down.

13:57.336 --> 13:58.379
Are you just going to...

14:05.427 --> 14:08.138
Teoritta, get away from there!

14:15.854 --> 14:18.107
My... My knight!

14:27.658 --> 14:29.827
Te-Teoritta!

14:33.581 --> 14:34.623
Run...

14:44.425 --> 14:45.926
Can't you hold on any longer...?

14:46.510 --> 14:47.761
- Run!
- Everyone!

14:47.845 --> 14:48.888
- It's over here!
- Retreat quickly!

14:48.971 --> 14:50.973
We can't have any more casualties!

14:51.056 --> 14:53.767
Tsav, hold the retreat route!

14:53.851 --> 14:56.061
No, I'm in trouble too!

14:57.062 --> 14:58.564
- It's over! Run!
- Hey!

14:59.607 --> 15:00.774
Can I escape too?

15:02.192 --> 15:04.987
Everyone, please don't come here!

15:05.070 --> 15:07.239
Stay where you are!

15:07.323 --> 15:09.408
Wait! Somebody help me!

15:09.491 --> 15:12.620
The mercenaries are going to kill me!

15:19.418 --> 15:21.211
Xylo, your wounds...

15:21.295 --> 15:23.380
Teoritta, get out of here...

15:23.464 --> 15:24.506
But I'm...

15:24.590 --> 15:27.009
Those faeries won't come to us now.

15:30.179 --> 15:32.222
You're already at your limit...

15:32.806 --> 15:34.224
I can tell.

15:38.812 --> 15:43.108
Actually... you're right.

15:47.571 --> 15:49.990
I can't accept my own kind...

15:51.659 --> 15:52.952
I...

15:54.411 --> 15:56.664
want to win meaningful battles.

15:57.706 --> 15:59.875
I want to think I'm something special.

16:00.960 --> 16:04.088
I want to believe I'm still worthy...

16:05.464 --> 16:08.008
It's such a stupid, pointless motive.

16:08.884 --> 16:09.843
But

16:11.845 --> 16:15.057
this is... my battle.

16:19.061 --> 16:20.020
My knight.

16:21.021 --> 16:23.190
No matter what you think,

16:23.273 --> 16:25.901
I will fight by your side.

16:28.904 --> 16:29.738
Because

16:30.447 --> 16:33.575
I am the great Goddess Teoritta.

16:35.786 --> 16:37.830
Yes, that's right.

16:38.330 --> 16:41.291
Xylo, if you do not wish for me to die,

16:41.375 --> 16:43.460
all you have to do is protect me.

16:44.044 --> 16:46.755
You are a great knight.

16:48.215 --> 16:49.341
I understand.

16:50.092 --> 16:52.469
Lend me your power, Teoritta.

16:53.470 --> 16:56.015
I'll decide where you put
your life on the line.

16:56.098 --> 16:56.932
Very well.

16:58.058 --> 17:00.519
I'll tell you when to die.

17:00.602 --> 17:01.520
Of course!

17:02.521 --> 17:04.648
That's why we must win!

17:11.363 --> 17:13.365
I will prepare a special sword.

17:14.700 --> 17:16.952
This time, it is a truly special sword...

17:20.039 --> 17:21.415
Will it be able to kill it?

17:22.082 --> 17:23.375
Kill that immortal?

17:23.959 --> 17:26.295
Yes. This is the Holy Sword.

17:26.378 --> 17:28.547
There is nothing it cannot destroy.

17:29.757 --> 17:32.217
I will summon it from beyond this world.

17:32.843 --> 17:35.804
You only have one breath.
I will definitely hold on.

17:36.972 --> 17:39.308
So you want me to hit it
in one blow, right?

17:40.768 --> 17:41.935
Leave it to me!

17:44.063 --> 17:44.980
Very well.

17:45.064 --> 17:48.734
We will not falter, yield, or submit!

18:14.218 --> 18:15.385
Xylo!

18:22.518 --> 18:23.852
Xylo!

18:23.936 --> 18:26.647
I lost the mercenaries!
What are you doing?

18:26.730 --> 18:27.898
Let's get out of here!

18:35.197 --> 18:39.118
I wondered why you suddenly went silent.
So that's where you were.

18:39.201 --> 18:42.121
This is the final shot.

18:48.794 --> 18:49.962
Teoritta!

18:50.045 --> 18:51.380
Now!

19:09.189 --> 19:12.985
Just die already!

19:18.782 --> 19:25.289
Nothing is indestructible
before the Holy Sword.

20:07.080 --> 20:07.998
See?

20:09.166 --> 20:11.835
I am great... right?

20:17.216 --> 20:18.050
Yeah...

20:19.134 --> 20:21.261
You're amazing...

20:26.225 --> 20:27.643
Xylo!

20:28.352 --> 20:30.479
Teoritta is there too, right?

20:30.562 --> 20:33.273
- If you're hurt, go back!
- You're too slow...

20:33.357 --> 20:35.317
Huh? Wait, Xylo!

20:42.950 --> 20:43.825
Where am I...?

20:44.660 --> 20:47.454
Hey, looks like you're awake.

20:48.121 --> 20:50.832
How are you feeling, Xylo?

20:54.211 --> 20:55.254
Who are you?

20:55.754 --> 20:57.589
Don't worry.

20:57.673 --> 21:00.259
Thankfully, you're not dead.

21:00.842 --> 21:03.387
You were just one step away.

21:03.470 --> 21:06.598
I've repaired your body,

21:06.682 --> 21:08.850
so you don't need to go
to the repair shop.

21:09.434 --> 21:13.522
But you might have
some memory confusion as an aftereffect.

21:14.273 --> 21:15.315
Who are you...?

21:15.941 --> 21:20.070
You can think of me
as one of your companions.

21:20.153 --> 21:23.949
Anyway, I'm relieved you're safe.

21:24.032 --> 21:28.495
After all,
the hero unit is our trump card.

21:29.955 --> 21:30.998
Get lost.

21:31.081 --> 21:32.833
That's cold.

21:32.916 --> 21:35.127
I went through a lot of trouble

21:35.210 --> 21:37.713
to come and see you secretly
like this, you know.

21:37.796 --> 21:41.258
It wasn't easy to deliver the gift.

21:45.220 --> 21:49.266
It seems to be a token of gratitude
from a nearby settlement.

21:49.349 --> 21:51.810
And it seems you've gained
popularity among the people

21:51.893 --> 21:53.895
as the "Soaring Lightning."

21:53.979 --> 21:55.105
Get out.

21:57.899 --> 21:59.067
I understand.

21:59.151 --> 22:01.528
I'll do as you wish.

22:02.487 --> 22:04.406
But I still want you to know this.

22:05.115 --> 22:07.117
It's not just civilians.

22:07.200 --> 22:10.245
People in the Temple and the military
are also keeping an eye

22:10.329 --> 22:11.913
on you heroes and your activities.

22:11.997 --> 22:13.373
Get out!

22:21.673 --> 22:24.593
Oh, and one last thing.

22:24.676 --> 22:28.555
Be careful not to disobey orders too much.

22:28.638 --> 22:33.143
There's a group that truly finds
you all to be an eyesore.

22:33.226 --> 22:37.022
You, in particular, are being
closely watched by a certain force.

22:37.105 --> 22:38.356
I thought so.

22:38.899 --> 22:41.902
They are called the coexisters.

22:41.985 --> 22:45.489
They are a group that advocates
integrating with the Demon Blight.

22:46.615 --> 22:48.158
Now, if you'll excuse me.

22:54.289 --> 22:55.373
It's over now.

22:55.457 --> 22:57.918
You can go in, Goddess.

22:58.835 --> 22:59.795
Xylo.

23:16.937 --> 23:18.605
My knight?

23:18.688 --> 23:21.733
What is with that look on your face?

23:23.693 --> 23:28.824
I, the great goddess,
have come to visit you myself.

23:34.371 --> 23:35.664
I am going to get angry.

23:36.581 --> 23:37.499
Xylo.

23:38.208 --> 23:40.961
If you do not wish to sing my praises

23:42.003 --> 23:43.755
or rub my head...

23:44.798 --> 23:46.049
that is fine....

23:47.843 --> 23:49.010
But...

23:49.094 --> 23:50.345
But if...

23:52.097 --> 23:54.266
If you forget about me...

23:55.684 --> 23:57.561
I will never forgive you.

24:05.443 --> 24:07.028
I haven't forgotten.

24:07.112 --> 24:08.155
Teoritta.

24:09.990 --> 24:12.742
So, don't cry.

24:17.414 --> 24:18.957
I am not crying...

24:20.333 --> 24:21.334
Is that so?

24:22.043 --> 24:23.879
Because I am great.

24:26.173 --> 24:27.132
Yeah...
